documentation-here \"\").\n",[288,290],{"plaintext":289},"/documentation/red_hat_ansible_automation_platform/2.7",{"plaintext":291},"/documentation/red_hat_ansible_automation_platform/2.7/*",{"uid":293,"title":282,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":284,"bannerText":294,"bannerVisibilityPaths":295,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"202606251",{"markdown":286},[296,298],{"plaintext":297},"/documentation/red_hat_ansible_automation_platform/2.6",{"plaintext":299},"/documentation/red_hat_ansible_automation_platform/2.6/*",{"uid":301,"title":302,"bannerVariant":303,"bannerType":304,"bannerText":305,"bannerVisibilityPaths":307,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"30","MCP server for Red Hat security content is a Developer Preview feature only","warning","warning banner",{"markdown":306},"For more information about the support scope of Red Hat Developer Preview features, see [Developer Preview - Scope of Support](https://access.redhat.com/support/offerings/devpreview \"\").\n",[308,310],{"plaintext":309},"/documentation/mcp_server_for_red_hat_security_content/*",{"plaintext":311},"/documentation/mcp_server_for_red_hat_security_content/1.0/*",{"uid":313,"title":314,"bannerVariant":303,"bannerType":304,"bannerText":315,"bannerVisibilityPaths":316,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"31","MCP server for Red Hat product information is a Developer Preview feature only",{"markdown":306},[317,319],{"plaintext":318},"/documentation/mcp_server_for_red_hat_product_information/*",{"plaintext":320},"/documentation/mcp_server_for_red_hat_product_information/1.0/*",{"uid":322,"title":323,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":325,"bannerVisibilityPaths":326,"latestVersionLink":337,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"20","You are viewing documentation for a release that is no longer maintained","end of life banner",{"markdown":230},[327,329,331,333,335],{"plaintext":328},"/documentation/builds_for_red_hat_openshift/1.0/*",{"plaintext":33