"title":323,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":423,"bannerVisibilityPaths":424,"latestVersionLink":429,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"19",{"markdown":230},[425,427],{"plaintext":426},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.14/*",{"plaintext":428},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/4.15/*","/documentation/red_hat_build_of_microshift/latest",{"uid":431,"title":432,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":433,"bannerVisibilityPaths":435,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"7","Red Hat Camel K is no longer supported.",{"markdown":434},"As of June 30, 2025, Red Hat build of Camel K has reached End of Life. The suggested replacements is [Red Hat build of Apache Camel](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_build_of_apache_camel \"\"). For details about moving, see the [Camel K to Camel Quarkus migration guide](https://docs.redhat.com/en/documentation/red_hat_build_of_apache_camel_k/latest/html/migration_guide_camel_k_to_camel_extensions_for_quarkus/index).\n",[436],{"plaintext":437},"/documentation/red_hat_build_of_apache_camel_k/*",{"uid":439,"title":323,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":440,"bannerVisibilityPaths":441,"latestVersionLink":458,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"12",{"markdown":230},[442,444,446,448,450,452,454,456],{"plaintext":443},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.0/*",{"plaintext":445},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.1/*",{"plaintext":447},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.2/*",{"plaintext":449},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.3/*",{"plaintext":451},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.4/*",{"plaintext":453},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.5/*",{"plaintext":455},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.6/*",{"plaintext":457},"/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/1.7/*","/documentation/red_hat_developer_hub/",{"uid":460,"title":461,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":462,"bannerVisibilityPaths":464,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"5","Red Hat Hyperconverged Infrastructure for Virtualization",{"markdown":463},"is in the [Maintenance Support Phase](https://access.redhat.com/support/policy/updates/rhhiv) of its lifecycle until October 31, 2024. After that date, the product will be End of Life. See the [RHHI-V announcement](https://access.redhat.com/announcements/6972521) for next steps.\n",[465],{"plaintext":466},"/documentation/red_hat_hyperconverged_infrastructure_for_virtualization/1.8",{"uid":468,"title":323,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":469,"bannerVisibilityPaths":470,"latestVersionLink":519,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"13",{"markdown":230},[471,473,475,477,479,481,483,485,487,489,491,493,495,497,499,501,503,505,507,509,511,513,515,517],{"plaintext":472},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.0/*",{"plaintext":474},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.1/*",{"plaintext":476},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.2/*",{"plaintext":478},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.3/*",{"plaintext":480},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.4/*",{"plaintext":482},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.5/*",{"plaintext":484},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.6/*",{"plaintext":486},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.7/*",{"plaintext":488},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.8/*",{"plaintext":490},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.9/*",{"plaintext":492},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.10/*",{"plaintext":494},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.11/*",{"plaintext":496},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.12/*",{"plaintext":498},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.13/*",{"plaintext":500},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.14/*",{"plaintext":502},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.15/*",{"plaintext":504},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.16/*",{"plaintext":506},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.17/*",{"plaintext":508},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.18/*",{"plaintext":510},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.19/*",{"plaintext":512},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.20/*",{"plaintext":514},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.21/*",{"plaintext":516},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.22/*",{"plaintext":518},"/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/3.23/*","/documentation/red_hat_openshift_dev_spaces/latest",{"uid":521,"title":323,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":522,"bannerVisibilityPaths":523,"latestVersionLink":534,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"16",{"markdown":230},[524,526,528,530,532],{"plaintext":525},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.0/*",{"plaintext":527},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.1/*",{"plaintext":529},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.2/*",{"plaintext":531},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.3/*",{"plaintext":533},"/documentation/red_hat_trusted_application_pipeline/1.4/*","/documentation/red_hat_advanced_developer_suite_-_software_supply_chain/latest",{"uid":536,"title":537,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":324,"bannerText":538,"bannerVisibilityPaths":540,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"4","The Red Hat Virtualization",{"markdown":539},"Maintenance Phase runs until August 31, 2024, followed by the Extended Life Phase with no more software fixes through August 31, 2026. See [Migration Paths for OpenShift Container Platform deployed on Red Hat Virtualization](https://access.redhat.com/articles/6975303\\) for details.\n",[541],{"plaintext":542},"/documentation/red_hat_virtualization/4.4",{"uid":544,"title":545,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":546,"bannerText":547,"bannerVisibilityPaths":549,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"10","Fuse 6 is no longer supported","preview banner",{"markdown":548},"As of February 2025, Red Hat Fuse 6 is no longer supported. If you are using Fuse 6, please upgrade to [Red Hat build of Apache Camel](https://developers.redhat.com/products/fuse/migration-red-hat-build-of-apache-camel).\n",[550,552,554,556,558],{"plaintext":551},"/documentation/red_hat_fuse/6.0/*",{"plaintext":553},"/documentation/red_hat_fuse/6.1/*",{"plaintext":555},"/documentation/red_hat_fuse/6.2/*",{"plaintext":557},"/documentation/red_hat_fuse/6.2.1/*",{"plaintext":559},"/documentation/red_hat_fuse/6.3/*",{"uid":561,"title":562,"bannerVariant":283,"bannerType":284,"bannerText":563,"bannerVisibilityPaths":565,"latestVersionLink":230,"viewAnnouncementLink":230},"21","This product is nearing End of Life",{"markdown":564},"The End of Life for Migration Toolkit for Containers is planned for December 31, 2026. For information about the sunset timeline and recommended alternatives, see [Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) about the Migration Toolkit for Containers sunset](https://access.redhat.com/articles/7137482\\ \"\").\n",[566,568,570,572,574,576,578,580,582,584,586,588,590,592,594,596,598,600,602,604,606,608,610,612,614,616,618,620,622,624,626,628,630,632,634,636,638,640,642,644],{"plaintext":567},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.12/html/migration_toolkit_for_containers/index/*",{"plaintext":569},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.12/html-single/migration_toolkit_for_containers/index/*",{"plaintext":571},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.12/html/migrating_from_version_3_to_4/index/*",{"plaintext":573},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.12/html-single/migrating_from_version_3_to_4/index/*",{"plaintext":575},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.13/html/migration_toolkit_for_containers/index/*",{"plaintext":577},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.13/html-single/migration_toolkit_for_containers/index/*",{"plaintext":579},"/documentation/openshift_container_platform/4.13/html/migrating_from_version_3_to_4/index/*",{"plaint